:: Statement-only formalization of Logipedia corpus artifact connectives.I,
:: catalog title "connectives.I": the module's distinguished abstract nullary
:: proposition connectives.True is asserted. This file contains no proof.

environ
  vocabularies TARSKI, XBOOLE_0, SUBSET_1, RELAT_1, FUNCT_1, FUNCT_2,
    MARGREL1, XBOOLEAN, ZFMISC_1, WAYBEL_4, CARDFIL2;
  notations TARSKI, XBOOLE_0, ZFMISC_1, RELAT_1, RELSET_1, FUNCT_1,
